  "text": "proprium.nativitas-domini-in-nocte-graduale",
  "about": "The graduale of the formulary “Nativity of the Lord — Mass during the Night” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "With Thee is dominion in the day of Thy power; in the splendors of the saints, from the womb before the day-star I begot Thee. The Lord said unto my Lord: Sit Thou at My right hand, until I make Thine enemies the footstool of Thy feet." }
